                                "text": "A growing number of cities across South Korea are sponsoring blind-dating events like these for singles, desperate to prod young adults onto a track for marriage and family as the country has recorded the world’s lowest fertility rate for three years in a row.[…]\nIn Gumi, an industrial city in central South Korea, 13 couples who met through the events have gotten married since 2016."
